Error [E1260]: A sandbox's exported function has an unsupported signature
 Why: `pub fn mixed` isn't one homogeneous `Int`, `Float`, `Bool`, or `Text` shape across its parameters and return type
 Fix: Every parameter and the return type must use the same scalar type: `Int`, `Float`, `Bool`, or `Text` — narrow the signature, or drop `pub` if this function isn't meant to be called across the sandbox boundary
